From 292f72297478c24111a93028e5f16e89b935f52f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Weidong Sun <sunweidong@linux.alibaba.com>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 12:10:40 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 04/10] feat(guest): locate Alibaba Cloud data disks by
 identity

Resolve Alibaba ESSD devices from stable by-id, sysfs serial and WWID identities across NVMe and virtio presentations. Normalize the requested disk identity, ignore partitions and virtual/root devices, wait for late udev discovery, and fail closed on ambiguous matches.

Keep the provider-specific locator isolated beside the existing AWS and Azure guest locators.

Signed-off-by: Weidong Sun <sunweidong@linux.alibaba.com>
